[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0010","text":"辛苦了，凛世\n通排下来感觉怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0020","text":"────感觉很……遥远……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0030","text":"遥远？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0040","text":"……是的\n观众席……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0050","text":"啊，原来如此\n比起之前的联合演出，会场也更大了嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0060","text":"不过，不用感到不安\n我觉得这是与现在的凛世们相称的会场"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0080","text":"──看到了吧？\n一直到最边上都看得清清楚楚"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0090","text":"——好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_02_0100","text":"嗯\n那就没问题了"}]
